Package: curtsy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: transparent TCP and UDP traffic forwarder
 Curtsy is a Zig-based Linux TCP and UDP traffic forwarder. It listens on one
 configured address and port and forwards traffic to one configured upstream
 without terminating TLS or inspecting forwarded payloads.
